          "jcr:created": "Wed Jun 29 2022 15:49:44 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Fluid management,</span> <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">made easy.</span></span></span></p>\n",
